# video/ — keep the reproducible SOURCES (scripts, narration, docs), ignore the
# large regenerable OUTPUT. Do NOT blanket-ignore `video/`: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded, so the sources would silently
# stay untracked. Ignore the specific artifacts instead.
video/out/
video/beats/
video/cards/
video/clips/
video/node_modules
*.mp4
